    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer proudly brings to the market in an exceptionally elevated position with breathtaking panoramic sea views, this outstanding detached residence offering a unique opportunity to acquire a home in such a privileged position on the Coast Road, Myrtleville. \r\n\r\nWithin a two minute walk to Myrtleville Beach, this property maximizes its spectacular coastal setting, every principal room is bathed in natural light and enjoys uninterrupted vistas across the water, creating a seamless connection between the home and its stunning surroundings. Whether watching the sunrise over the sea, entertaining on the terrace, or simply relaxing with the ever-changing coastal landscape as your backdrop, this is a home that offers an extraordinary lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe property has been extremely well cared for both internally and externally which is obvious for everyone to see having been a wonderful home for decades with a good blend of accommodation throughout. At ground floor level, it has a welcoming entrance hall, large open plan dining/living room, kitchen, sun lounge to the rear, utility room, two bedrooms and shower room. At first floor level, it has a massive landing/living area with access onto the balcony with spectacular views of the surrounding coastline, two bedrooms and main bathroom. \r\n\r\nOutside, beautifully landscaped gardens frame the property, offering privacy, space and multiple areas for outdoor dining and relaxation while making the very most of the magnificent sea views. Ample parking and the detached nature of the home further enhance its appeal.\r\n\r\nSituated in one of the area's most sought-after locations in Cork, this exceptional residence combines peaceful coastal living with convenient access to local amenities, excellent schools, leisure facilities and transport links. Crosshaven village is just a 5 minutes drive and importantly, there is a regular public bus service available close-by direct to Cork City Centre which is just a short commute along with Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy. \r\n\r\nHomes in such an enviable setting like this rarely become available. This is a truly special property that must be experienced to be fully appreciated."
      },
