      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: 162 sq metres (1,742 sq ft)\r\nPrivate elevated site\r\nBreathtaking unterupted views over Myrtleville Beach, Cork Harbour & surround Headland\r\nOil Fired Central Heating \r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows & Doors\r\nExceptional detached coastal residence\r\nImpeccably presented throughout\r\nSpacious light-filled accommodation\r\nBeautifully landscaped gardens and generous outdoor entertaining areas\r\nPrivate tarmacadam driveway with ample parking\r\nPrestigious and highly desirable location\r\nA rare opportunity to acquire a truly outstanding family home\r\nMins walk to Myrtleville Beach \r\n2 mins to Fountainstown Beach\r\n5 minutes to Crosshaven village\r\nShort commute to Cork Airport & Cork City Centre\r\nEasy access to a regular public bus service"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
