      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Carrigaline, drive down the Crosshaven Road passing Carrigaline GAA Grounds.  Pass Carrigaline Business Park and take the next right (signposted for Fountainstown/Myrtleville).  Continue on this road and keep left at McWilliam Sailmakers for Crosshaven. Continue up the hill and just before Crosshaven Rugby Club, turn right signposted for Myrtleville. Continue on this road to Myrtleville, passing The Lodge Bar & Restaurant, keeping right onto Coast road, passing the entrance to former Bunny Connellan's on the left handside. Continue on this road for approximately 300/400 metres and take the next right hand turn (see arrow sign post). The property is located on the right handside, indicated by our \"For Sale\" sign. Follow Eircode: P43 RR62"
      }
